    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d217-a1">

                <pb facs="0342" n="254" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg254"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Murray to Mr.
                            Loomis.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Pittsburg, Tex.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-12-16"><hi rendition="#italic">December 16,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir</hi>: I am in receipt of your letter of the
                    23d ultimo, regarding the case against the murderer of my father, E. A. Murray.
                    Kindly inform me what is <pb facs="0343" n="255" xml:id="pg255"/> necessary to
                    procure counsel to assist the State in the prosecution. My address will be here
                    in Pittsburg, Tex., from now on, so you can address any and all letters to me
                    here and I will receive them.</p>
                <p>Yours, very respectfully,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson A. Murray.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
